%% Shared colour classes — paste right after the "flowchart TD" line of each diagram and rename the classes to the roles of the process.
%% Each node reads "<step no>. <Role>: <action>" (in Vietnamese, like the RSD) and gets its role class; decisions use :::dec.
    classDef kd fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,color:#111
    classDef tp fill:#f4ecfb,stroke:#7e57c2,color:#3b1f63
    classDef ht fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#4a7ab5,color:#14365d
    classDef dh fill:#fff1e6,stroke:#e07b39,color:#6b3410
    classDef kt fill:#e9f7f3,stroke:#2e9c7a,color:#124d3c
    classDef dec fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#c9a227,color:#5a4500
    classDef stop fill:#eaf6ea,stroke:#3c8d3c,color:#1d4d1d
    classDef bad fill:#fdecec,stroke:#c0504d,color:#6b1f1d
